---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | Abrany';
const pageDescription = 'Privacy policy';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} headerVariant="transparent">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[920px] px-6 pt-32 pb-24 text-foreground md:pt-40" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dnkj5a">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-h1 leading-[1.2] tracking-[1px] text-primary" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:12kscx">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 font-sans text-base leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.2px]" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:pffnzr">
      <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jva">Effective Date: December 24, 2024</p>

      <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jvb">
        Welcome to Abrany (abrany.com). Your privacy is important to us, and we are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our services.
      </p>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2re">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4vh">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jvc">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8es">Personal Information: Name, email address, phone number, and other details you provide when contacting us or subscribing to our services.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8er">Non-Personal Information: Browser type, IP address, and browsing behavior, collected automatically through cookies and similar technologies.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2rd">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uv">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jvd">We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8eq">Provide, maintain, and improve our services.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8ep">Respond to inquiries, requests, or feedback.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8eo">Send marketing and promotional materials (with your consent).</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8en">Analyze website usage to improve user experience.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2rc">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uu">3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jve">We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your browsing experience. These cookies may collect data about your browsing behavior, preferences, and device usage.</p>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw0">You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. However, this may affect some features of our website.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2rb">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4ut">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw1">We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties, except in the following cases:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8em">With service providers who assist in operating our website or services.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8el">To comply with legal obligations or respond to lawful requests.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8ek">To protect our rights, property, or safety.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2ra">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4us">5. Your Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw2">Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8ej">Access, correct, or delete your personal information.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8dx">Object to data processing or withdraw consent.</li>
          <li data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:cuv8dw">Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority.</li>
        </ul>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw3">To exercise your rights, please contact us at <a class="underline underline-offset-2 text-primary hover:text-secondary" href="mailto:hello@abrany.com" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:tu2le3">hello@abrany.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2r9">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4ur">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw4">Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external sites.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2r8">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uq">7. Security of Your Information</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw5">We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal data. However, no system is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2r7">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4up">8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw6">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The revised version will be effective upon posting on this page.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y5a2r6">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xl leading-[1.4] text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:dlu4uo">9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw7">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <p data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:y33jw8">
          Abrany<br />
          Website: <a class="underline underline-offset-2 text-primary hover:text-secondary" href="/" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:tu2le2">abrany.com</a><br />
          Email:&nbsp;<a class="underline underline-offset-2 text-primary hover:text-secondary" href="mailto:hello@abrany.com" data-ps="src/pages/privacy-policy.astro:tu2le1">hello@abrany.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
